<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Ngsreport on</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/categories/ngsreport/</link><description>Recent content in Ngsreport on</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://younsoid.github.io/categories/ngsreport/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>CNV Type 수정, 중복 샘플 제거</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/db-construction/nw14/</link><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/db-construction/nw14/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="cnv-type-수정-중복-샘플-제거"&gt;&#10; CNV Type 수정, 중복 샘플 제거&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#cnv-type-%ec%88%98%ec%a0%95-%ec%a4%91%eb%b3%b5-%ec%83%98%ed%94%8c-%ec%a0%9c%ea%b1%b0"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-07-06&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="1-작업-개요"&gt;&#10; 1. 작업 개요&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#1-%ec%9e%91%ec%97%85-%ea%b0%9c%ec%9a%94"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;기존 작업에서 326명의 NGS Report 추출 결과를 바탕으로 CNV, Fusion, MSI, TMB 데이터를 추출해줬다. 이번 작업에서는 중복인 샘플에 대해서 SNV 추출시 Report를 사용했던 데이터만 남기도록 중복 샘플을 제거해주고, CNV Type이 4분류였던걸 Gain Loss 2분류로 바꿔주려고 한다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id=""&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="2-작업-내용"&gt;&#10; 2. 작업 내용&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#2-%ec%9e%91%ec%97%85-%eb%82%b4%ec%9a%a9"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;cnv_data &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; pd&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;read_csv(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;/Users/yshmbid/Documents/home/github/kosmos/workspace/data/0703/368명_대상자_CNV.csv&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;fusion_data &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; pd&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;read_csv(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;/Users/yshmbid/Documents/home/github/kosmos/workspace/data/0703/368명_대상자_Fusion.csv&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;msi_data &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; pd&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;read_csv(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;/Users/yshmbid/Documents/home/github/kosmos/workspace/data/0703/368명_대상자_MSI_TMB.csv&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;tmb_data &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; pd&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;read_csv(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;/Users/yshmbid/Documents/home/github/kosmos/workspace/data/0703/368명_대상자_TMB.csv&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;print(cnv_data[&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;COYP_NO_ATRT_TYPE&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;]&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;value_counts(dropna&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;False&lt;/span&gt;))&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;cnv_data&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;img width="1280" height="640" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c5d95353-4f9b-471e-a0da-c82a0ec91f2f" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;먼저 CNV 데이터의 Copy Number Type을 확인해보면 위와 같다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>NGS Report 정제 - CNV, Fusion, MSI, TMB</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/db-construction/nw13/</link><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/db-construction/nw13/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="ngs-report-정제---cnv-fusion-msi-tmb"&gt;&#10; NGS Report 정제 - CNV, Fusion, MSI, TMB&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#ngs-report-%ec%a0%95%ec%a0%9c---cnv-fusion-msi-tmb"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-07-06&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="1-작업-개요"&gt;&#10; 1. 작업 개요&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#1-%ec%9e%91%ec%97%85-%ea%b0%9c%ec%9a%94"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;기존 분석에서 분석 대상자 368명 중 FMI 데이터가 있는 27명에 대해서 데이터 추출 작업을 수행해줬다. 이번 분석에서는 CNV, Fusion, MSI, TMB 데이터가 있는 대상자에 대해서 데이터 추출 작업을 진행할 예정이다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id=""&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="2-작업-내용"&gt;&#10; 2. 작업 내용&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#2-%ec%9e%91%ec%97%85-%eb%82%b4%ec%9a%a9"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-python" data-lang="python"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; os&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; pandas &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; pd&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;data_tool_01 &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; pd&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;read_excel(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;r&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;C:\Users\User\Documents\yshid\2607\data