pan style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;VAF&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;TIRE_CD3&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;]]&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;data_tool_03 &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; data_tool_03[[&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;SUBJ_ID&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;CRF_REPEATKEY&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;BRND_CD_REL_1&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;BRND_NM_VER_REL_1&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;ITEMGROUP_REPEATKEY_1&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;GENE_CMNT&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;GENE_CHNG_SITE_NM&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;GENE_CHNG_SITE_CHR&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;CHRM_SOME_CMNT&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;STRT_LOCA_CMNT&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;END_LOCA_CMNT&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;COYP_NO_ATRT_TYPE&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;ECT&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;FCCN_CNT&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;CN_CNT&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;ADJV_CN_CNT&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;TIRE_CD&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;EBDN_LEVL_CD&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;]]&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;data_tool_04 &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; data_tool_04[[&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;SUBJ_ID&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;CRF_REPEATKEY&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;VRNT_CD&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;BRND_CD_REL_2&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;BRND_NM_VER_REL_2&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;ITEMGROUP_REPEATKEY_1&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;FUSI_GENE&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;GENE1_CMNT&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;GENE1_BREK_PONT&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;GENE2_CMNT&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;GENE2_BREK_PONT&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;FUSI_SPPR_READ_CNT&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;DTCT_MTHD_CD&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;TIRE_CD2&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#39;EBDN_LEVL_CD2&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;]]&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;with&lt;/span&gt; open(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;r&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;C:\Users\User\Documents\yshid\2607\data\add_total_sid_0702.txt&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;r&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;) &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; f:&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; add_sid &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; [line&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;strip() &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; line &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; f &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; line&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;strip()]&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;len(add_sid) &lt;span style="color:#75715e"&gt;# 368&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;CNV, Fusion, MSI, TMB 데이터는 eCRF의 Data Tool 파일에 존재하는데, sheet 0에 MSI와 TMB, sheet 1에 CNV 정보, sheet 2에 Fusion 정보가 있다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>HER2 CNV 작업</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/db-construction/nw6/</link><pubDate>Fri, 05 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/db-construction/nw6/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="her2-cnv-작업"&gt;&#10; HER2 CNV 작업&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#her2-cnv-%ec%9e%91%ec%97%85"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-06-05&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="1-분석-개요"&gt;&#10; 1. 분석 개요&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#1-%eb%b6%84%ec%84%9d-%ea%b0%9c%ec%9a%94"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;KOSMOS-II 데이터를 활용한 연구 중에서 연세암병원에서 진행 중인 HER2 유전자의 CN 정보를 활용하는 연구가 있다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="392" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/98407a27-f349-404d-8b92-5c8afcca45b4" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;KOSMOS-II 데이터에서 CNV의 CN 정보는 위와 같은 구성이고 이중 CN 수치 정보는 CN_CNT, ADJV_CN_CNT 정도이다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;연세암병원 연구는 121명 중 CN_CNT를 가진 환자 48명을 사용해서 분석을 진행했는데 전체 CN 데이터를 요청주셨다. 이에 NGS 데이터가 존재하는 119명의 CNV를 확인해보고 자료를 전달해줘야 한다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="2-cnv-정보-확인"&gt;&#10; 2. CNV 정보 확인&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#2-cnv-%ec%a0%95%eb%b3%b4-%ed%99%95%ec%9d%b8"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;img width="1280" height="605" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ef666054-d028-40e8-a38e-56433177d352" /&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;우선 119명 중 ERBB2의 CNV 데이터가 존재하는 환자는 83명, 데이터 수는 86개이다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>